 # @mastra/editor
 
+## 0.7.24
+
+### Patch Changes
+
+- Fixed peer dependency ranges so packages that use the Mastra server require a compatible Mastra core version. ([#16208](https://github.com/mastra-ai/mastra/pull/16208))
